00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:05.860
Could you guys please share with people how this Christmas card thing came about?

120
00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:08.920
It's because you're maybe, like, distant relatives, right?

121
00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:11.300
Well, this is our joke.

122
