00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:50.520
I appreciate it, though.

268
00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:51.540
I got some noodles in my car.

269
00:12:57.700 --> 00:12:59.180
Sorry, I'm cracking myself up, Greg.

270
00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:01.160
Thank you, I mean...

271
00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:05.040
I got some noodles in my car, so we could juSt...

